- run_tests: Run pytest only with specific targets (files, directories, or node IDs like test/test_foo.py::test_case). Always uses -x (stop on first failure) and --tb=short. Do not pass shell commands, Python scripts such as python script.py or python reproduce_issue.py, pytest command lines, cd, pipes, redirects, or shell operators. If you need a diagnostic, write a pytest-style test file and run that file as the target. Use read_file or search_code for file operations.

